 "contract": {
  "centre_pixel": "the brush_cases.json transform with floor; a sample outside the image (null) paints nothing",
  "footprint": "{(x, y) : (x-cx)^2 + (y-cy)^2 <= r^2, 0 <= x < Nx, 0 <= y < Ny} in SOURCE pixels, so zoom and pan cannot change what a stamp covers; r = 0 is the centre pixel only",
